          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Ginsburg asked whether the emergency suspension of Iraq\u2019s immunity, which had a one\u2011year sunset, means that immunity revived after the statute expired."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "4a3fc18f745c662985bcf5ad83f5aad978c9da9eed53ed106067e5daf58caf66",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-4a3fc18f745c-0000-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 7,
              "start": 7
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Alito, justice Alito questioned whether Congress intended to grant the President authority to suspend immunity in this manner."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Stevens",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "4a3fc18f745c662985bcf5ad83f5aad978c9da9eed53ed106067e5daf58caf66",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-4a3fc18f745c-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 38,
              "start": 38
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Stevens, justice Stevens inquired whether the discussion concerns other provisions of law affecting court jurisdiction or foreign assistance."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "4a3fc18f745c662985bcf5ad83f5aad978c9da9eed53ed106067e5daf58caf66",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-4a3fc18f745c-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Ginsburg also asked whether any settlement must consider the impact on the Iraqi people, who were the primary victims of terrorism."
      }
    ],
